{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Estimated play time 30 minutes to 2 hours</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your surroundings for anomalies, follow the protocols. Signal Intentions is an anomaly game taking place in three different areas of an office, each with its own set of anomalies, and playbook.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Anomaly spotting game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies, hiding in plain sight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/extras/19450b44a50b7f7e18df43ed2fb8435a.poster.avif?t=1766929870\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/extras/19450b44a50b7f7e18df43ed2fb8435a.webm?t=1766929870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/extras/19450b44a50b7f7e18df43ed2fb8435a.mp4?t=1766929870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Areas </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three different areas of the office presented in three different chapters, each with their own set of anomalies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your camera is not for capturing the scenery, capture any anomalies you see to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/extras/354c2c32ed59c63b4deec002efd52358.poster.avif?t=1766929870\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/extras/354c2c32ed59c63b4deec002efd52358.webm?t=1766929870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/extras/354c2c32ed59c63b4deec002efd52358.mp4?t=1766929870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Closing Up</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeting's over, it's time for you to leave the area, but make sure you follow the procedure, or you may find yourself stuck here forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/extras/84adeeabc1885a9965c14b8f4906c46f.poster.avif?t=1766929870\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/extras/84adeeabc1885a9965c14b8f4906c46f.webm?t=1766929870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/extras/84adeeabc1885a9965c14b8f4906c46f.mp4?t=1766929870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intentions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look through the cameras at the experiment site, report any anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/extras/bfaaf618b0b32105edebecbefaeb01f7.poster.avif?t=1766929870\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/extras/bfaaf618b0b32105edebecbefaeb01f7.webm?t=1766929870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/extras/bfaaf618b0b32